From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 26 May 2026 22:07:58 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add Alcazar Capital Management Next.js 15 website

Full-stack landing page for Alcazar Capital Management built with
Next.js 15, TypeScript, Tailwind CSS v4, and Framer Motion.

Sections: Hero (animated network background + staggered text),
About, Strategy (PSIF + Algorithmic Hedging with SVG diagrams),
Research & Insights, Team, Contact form, Footer.

https://claude.ai/code/session_01UArYSqYPKJfTzweCuWjqsT
